         "title": "Move Over / Generationext (Live)",
         "country": "UK & Europe",
         "released": "1997",
         "notes": "J-card case.\n\nPublished by Windswept Pacific Music Limited/Copyright Control\n\n℗ 1997 The copyright in this sound recording is owned by Virgin Records Ltd.\n© 1997 EMI Records\n© 1997 Virgin Records Ltd.\nMade in UK\n\nOne of two white stickers is affixed to the back of the slimline jewel case on some copies:\n\"SG PML 98\n8 715600 221800\"\nor \n\"GENERATIONEXT\n9 009700 300251\"\n\nThere is no actual promotional notice on the artwork, but this release was part of Pepsi Music Live, a special promotion by Pepsi in 1997 and 1998 where ring-pulls from Pepsi cans could be traded for one of four CDs containing live tracks. The live tracks were then also made available as a separate compilation issue: [r=1074346]. ",
