         "title": "We Are The Greatest / I Was Made For Lovin' You",
         "country": "UK & Europe",
         "released": "1998-09-21",
         "notes": "Track 1 has several influences/covers:\n\"Street Dance\" by Break Machine for the \"whistling sample\"\n\"Don't Stop the Rock\" by Freestyle for lyrics\n\"Electric City\" by Music Instructor for bassline, track layout and construction\n\nTrack 2 covers melody and vocals of the same-named track by KISS.\n\nPublished by Loop Dance Constructions Musikverlag GmbH. Except track 2: Published by Polygram Songs\nRecorded at Loop D.C. Studio 1, Hamburg, Germany.\nScooter Management: J. Thele\nMade in Germany by Optimal.\n(p) 1998 Loop Dance Constructions GmbH/\"edel\" records GmbH\n© 1998 \"edel\" records GmbH\nTaken from the album: \"No time to chill\"\n\nDistribution:\nD: edel company\nA: emv\nCH: Phonag\nE: edel Music S.A.\nI: edel Italia\nScandinavia: edelpitch AB\nSF: edelpitch/K-Tel\nUK: edel UK\n\nRunning Time: 14:46",
