         "notes": "Produced for Bass Bumpers Music.\nLara McAllen appears courtesy of Active Music Management. Vocals recorded and produced at Sarm West.\nContains a sample of 'Do You Know'. Written by Shep Solomon & Michelle Gayle. Published by Rondor Music London Ltd / First Avenue Music Ltd.\nContains a sample of 'Children'. Written by Roberto Concina. Published by BMG Music Publishing Ltd / Jeity Music SAS.\n02 & 05 additional production and remix for Absolutely Records.\n\n℗ 2004 Data Records / Ministry of Sound Recordings Ltd.\n© 2004 Data Records/Ministry of Sound Recordings Ltd.\nMade in England.",
