         "released": "2003-12-08",
         "notes": "- German release with additional booklet page with ringtones advert.\n- Artist & title are printed in neon orange on front inlay and CD.\n\n---\n\nPublished by Warner/Chappell / Hanseatic.\nThis is an analogue recording. Made at Loop D.C. Studio 1, Hamburg, Europe.\nThanks to Mrs. Aya Puster for Japanese translation.\n\"Jigga Jigga!\" has been produced by Scooter for Sheffield Tunes communications. ℗2004 Sheffield Tunes ©2004 Sheffield Tunes\nFor more information about Scooter send S.A.E. to: Scooter, P.O. Box 710264, D-22162 Hamburg or www.scootertechno.com.\n\nwww.scootertechno.com\nPrinted and manufactured in Germany by Optimal\nDistributed by Edel Distribution GmbH\n\nPrinted on CD:\n℗+©2004 Sheffield Tunes.\nMade in Germany by Optimal.",
