         "title": "Set Me Free (Empty Rooms)",
         "country": "Germany",
         "released": "2004-05-17",
         "notes": "Titel 1/2/4/5: Published by: Edition Allstar II, Sony / ATV Music Publishing, Allstar III, B612 Publishing. Produced for Allstar Music Productions at Allstar Studio, Frankfurt/Germany. [a745336] appears courtesy of CMC / Virgin Music.\n\nTitel 3/6 remixed and additional production for Topless Entertainment\nTitel 7 remixed and additional production for Maratone Music, Hamburg.\n\n\"Set Me Free (Empty Rooms)\" is taken from the forthcoming album \"[url=http://www.discogs.com/master/92479]Tripomatic Fairytales 3003[/url]\".\n\nAlle titel: ℗ 2004 Polydor Island GmbH, a division of Universal Music GmbH. Made in the EU.\n\nThe sticker on j-card cast states \"the new single! feat. [a745336] from [a101907] incl. [a61842] & [a10610] rmx 986 637-2.\" Inlay contains song lyrics.",
