         "title": "U Can't Touch This",
         "country": "Europe",
         "released": "2003",
         "notes": "Different matrix than on release [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/10515435]10515435[/url].\nAlso in comparison, the cat# under the barcode is: 5524122\nThis release also has more text under the Copy Control info on the back flip.\n\nTracks 1-4:\nBust It Publishing / Stone City / Jobete Music / Stone Diamond Music / Melodie Der Welt / EMI Music Publishing Germany\nTrack 5:\nCopyright Control\n\nTracks 1 & 2 produced, arranged & engineered @ Cyrus Trax Studio.\nTrack 3 remix & additional production for S-Cape Music Production.\nTrack 4 remix & additional production for Yawa Production.\nTrack 5 written & produced @ Cyrus Trax Studio.\n\n(P) 2003 the copyright in this sound recording is owned by Capitol Records, Inc., \nexcept track 5 (P) 2003 the copyright in this sound recording is owned by Capitol Music, a division of EMI Music Germany GmbH & Co. KG\n(C) 2003 EMI Music Germany GmbH & Co. KG\nManufactured and distributed by the \nEMI Music Group Australasia.\nPrinted in the Australia.\n\nThis edition was also released in Australia.",
