         "title": "By The Way",
         "country": "Europe",
         "released": "2002-07-09",
         "notes": "An identical version, but with a slipcase, is [r28627984].\nSimilar to [r=6212674] which is pressed by [l=Cinram GmbH].\n\nReleased with clear tray and 14-page foldout booklet containing credits, lyrics and photos.\n\nBack:\n© ℗ 2002 Warner Bros. Records Inc. for the U.S. and WEA International Inc. for the world outside the U.S.\nMade in Germany by Warner Music Manufacturing Europe.\n\nBooklet:\nRecorded at Cello Studios, Los Angeles, CA, and Chateau Marmont, LA, CA\nStrings Recorded at Warner Bros. Studios\nMixed at The Village Recorder, Los Angeles, CA.\n© 2002 Moebetoblame Music BMI\nPre-production @ The Swinghouse\n\nDisc:\n© ℗ 2002 Warner Bros. Records Inc.\nMade in Germany by Warner Music Manufacturing Europe.\n\nSome copies with hype sticker (red circular with pink asterisk):\nBY THE WAY\nIncludes the hits \"By The Way\" and \"The Zephyr Song\"\n\"...the year's best rock record.\" - Spin\n\"★★★★\" - Rolling Stone\n16 songs\nover 68 minutes of music\n9362-48140-2\n\nAlternative hype sticker (Black square white lettering):\n'A fantastic record, full of wonder' ★★★★★ Q\n'A giant leap onwards ..........it's wonderful' ★★★★ Kerrrang !\n'their most melodic, ambitious and satisfying album yet' ★★★★ Heat\n'one hell of a record' The Mirror\n'This is overwhelmingly another triumph' The Telegraph\n'A stunning masterpiece' B\n'what may be the album of the year' The Sun\n9362-48140-2",
         "released_formatted": "09 Jul 2002",
