         "released": "2000",
         "notes": "Released in a regular jewel case with clear tray and a 20-page booklet.\n\nBooklet:\nRecorded at Guillaume Tell Studios, Paris.\nMastered at Sterling Sound, New York\n\nAll titles administered by Zomba Music Publishers Ltd except tracks 1,2,3 and 9 administered by Zomba Music Publishers Ltd./Warner/Chappell Music Ltd.\n\n℗ 2000 The copyright in this sound recording is owned by Iron Maiden Holdings Ltd. under exclusive licence to Iron Maiden Holdings Ltd.\n© 2000 Iron Maiden Holdings Ltd.\n\nRear:\n℗ 2000 The copyright in this sound recording is owned by Iron Maiden Holdings Ltd. under exclusive licence to EMI Records Ltd.\n© 2000 Iron Maiden Holdings Ltd.\nPrinted in EU\n\nCD: Made in EU.\n\nTrack 10 title in booklet is \"The Thin Line Between Love And Hate\"\n\n7243 5 26605 2 0 is printed on spine and back inlay.\n5 26605 2 is the part printed in bold.\n526 6052 is printed on back inlay.\n5266052 is printed in booklet, p. 12.\n\n526 6052 is credited as the UK cat#.",
