         "notes": "℗ 1996 Motor Music GmbH © 1996 Motor Music GmbH\n\nPrinted in Germany.\n\nArtist appear as \"Robert M1lƐs\". Some copies with round white on red hype sticker.\n\nStandard jewel case with black tray including 10-page folded booklet:\n- 6 both sides printed pages:\none side with [a1827433]'s illustration (3 pages)\nother side (3 pages) with [a1827433]'s cover, tracklisting & durations,credits, thanks, miscellaneous quotes & other informations:\n' This album is dedicated to all those people who seek emotion, reflection and peace in music.'\n' A special thanks goes to [a1504] and [a4493099] for the help and all the (many) hours they devoted to make this project a successful one. '\n' Also many thanks go out to Francesca & Francesca, Ornella, Giorgio, [a4663] and to all the people who have helped me along the way. Lolly for his technical advice, Rosangela, Giacomo, Katia, Stefano, my parents... without whom all this would never have been... and myself. '\n' ... all songs arranged and produced at Sound Master Studio, Italy.\nPublished by [l269280] - Milano, Italy and [l288393] '\nUnder exclusive license from [l6857] Italy. Robert Miles Management: F & G London.\n\n- 4 page PolyGram market research form (see images section).",
