         "title": "The Best Of 1980-1990 & B-Sides (CD 2)",
         "country": "Europe",
         "released": "1998-11-03",
         "notes": "Standard 2CD jewel case with clear tray including 16-page booklet containing credits and photos.\nUsually comes with sticker on front panel:\n\"Special Edition / Double CD / Featuring / The Best Of & The 'B' Sides 1980-1990\"\n\nOn back:\nThis compilation: ℗ 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V. © 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V.\nThe copyright in this artwork is owned by PolyGram International Music B.V. and is exclusively licensed to Island Records Ltd to the UK. Island Records is a PolyGram company.\n\nOn back inside:\nAll tracks ℗ Island Records Ltd.\nTrack 15 ℗ 1982 / 13 ℗ 1983 / 1, 4, 5 ℗ 1985 /  2, 3, 9, 10, 12 ℗ 1987 / 6 to 8 ℗ 1989 / 11, 14 ℗ 1988\n\nOn booklet:\nAll titles published by PolyGram International Music Publishing BV, except Blue Mountain Music Ltd. (UK), Mother Music (IRL), Tay Music Inc. (Japan).\n\nPrinciple Management Dublin and New York\n\nAll tracks have been digitally remastered from original master tapes where possible by Arnie Acosta at The Mastering Lab, Los Angeles.\nAudio post production manager and technical guru: Cheryl Engels at Partial Productions Inc.\n\nThis compilation: ℗ 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V. © 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V.\n\nOn CD 1&2:\nThis compilation: ℗ 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V. © 1998 PolyGram International Music B.V.\nThe copyright in this artwork is owned by PolyGram International Music B.V. and is exclusively licensed to Island Records Ltd.\n\n\nTrack 1-14 actually has a duration of 9:52 minutes. After \"All I Want Is You\" (track 1-14a, 6:31 min., duration stated for the track on release) and one minute of silence, hidden track \"October\" (1-14b, 2:21 min.) starts at minute 7:30.",
         "released_formatted": "03 Nov 1998",
