         "title": "Symbols",
         "country": "US",
         "released": "2007-05-08",
         "notes": "Comes in a jewel case with a 28 page booklet and a sticker on the shrinkwrap. The album title does not appear prominently on the release but is mentioned in the liner notes.\r\n\r\nPreproduced in Seattle at the SoundHouse.\r\nTracked in Seattle at Luftschutzbunker.\r\nRecorded in Seattle at Bad Animals.\r\nMastered at Bernie Grundman Mastering, Hollywood.\r\n\r\nAll songs ℗ & © 2007, Metropolis Records / KMFDM Inc.\r\nTracks 1 to 6 and 8 to 10 published by KMFDM Ent. US (BMI).\r\nTrack 7 published by KMFDM Ent. US (BMI) and The Happy Beaver.\r\n\r\nMade in the USSA.\r\n℗ & © 2007 Metropolis Records.\r\n℗ & © 2007 KMFDM Inc.\r\n",
         "released_formatted": "08 May 2007",
