         "released": "1999-06-22",
         "notes": "Initial copies had sticker on front stating \"Limp Bizkit new album - includes nookie, break stuff, n 2 gether now - 490 335-2/IND 90335\"\n\nTrack 15 has 2 hidden tracks. The first one starts at 2:25 and the second at 4:36. \nTrack 16 is 'empty' (no sound). \n\nMultimedia part:\n- Video (fast motion of people spraying the CD cover picture + Limp Bizkit writing)\n- Limp Bizkit wallpaper\n- internet link (not working)\n\n℗ 1999 Flip/Interscope Records. © 1999 Flip/Interscope Records, a Universal Music company.\n\nReleased in standard jewel case.\nMade in the EU.",
