         "title": "Chocolate Starfish And The Hot Dog Flavored Water",
         "country": "Europe",
         "released": "2000",
         "notes": "\"My Way\" contains a sample from \"My Melody\" (E.Barrier/W.Griffin) Robert Hill Music/Universal Songs Of PolyGram International, Inc. (BMI) as recorded by Eric B. And Rakim.\r\n\"Livin' It Up\" contains a sample from \"Life In The Fast Lane\" (G.Frey/D.Henley/J.Walsh) Cass County Music Co./Red Cloud Music Co./Wow And Flutter Music Co. (ASCAP) as recorded by The Eagles.\r\n\r\nAll songs:\r\nZomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP).\r\nExcept:\r\n\"Hot Dog\" Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP)/Leaving Hope Music/TVT Music, Inc. (ASCAP), administered by Leaving Hope Music, Inc.\r\n\"My Way\" Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP)/Robert Hill Music/Universal Songs Of PolyGram International, Inc. (BMI).\r\n\"Livin' It Up\" Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP)/Cass County Music Co, Red Cloud Music Co, Wow And Flutter Music (ASCAP).\r\n\"Getcha Groove On\" Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP) and Hennessey For Everyone (BMI)/Voco Music Publishing (BMI).\r\n\"Take A Look Around\" Bruin Music Company (BMI)/Famous Music Corporation (ASCAP).\r\n\"Hold On\" Flaming Music/EMI April Music (ASCAP)/Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP).\r\n\"Rollin' (Urban Assault Vehicle)\" Swizz Beatz Publishing (ASCAP)/Zomba Enterprises, Inc./Big Bizkit Music (administered by Zomba Enterprises, Inc.) (ASCAP)/Boomer X Publishing (ASCAP)/Dead Game Publishing (ASCAP)/Careers/BMG Music Publishing/Funky Noble Productions, Inc. (ASCAP).\r\n\r\nRecording studios:\r\nLarrabee East Sound Studios, Los Angeles, CA.\r\nWestlake Studio, Los Angeles, CA.\r\nLarrabee West Sound Studios, West Hollywood, CA.\r\nStudio Litho, Seattle, WA.\r\nNRG Recording Services, North Hollywood, CA.\r\nSouth Beach Studio, Miami Beach, FL.\r\n\r\nAdditional protools engineering:\r\nThe Hit Factory, NYC, NY.\r\nOlympic Studios, London, England.\r\nSony Music Studios, NYC, NY.\r\nLong View Farms Studios, North Brookfield, MA.\r\n\r\nMix studios:\r\nAll tracks mixed at Soundtracks Studios, NYC, NY.\r\nExcept:\r\n\"Take A Look Around\" mixed at Southern Tracks Recording, Atlanta, GA.\r\n\"Getcha Groove On\" mixed at Daddy's House Recording Studios, NYC, NY.\r\n\"Rollin' (Urban Assault Vehicle)\" mixed at Sony Music Studios, NYC, NY.\r\n\r\nMastered at Sony Music Studios, NYC, NY.\r\nClean edits on \"My Generation\" for Works Of Mart, Inc and C.R.E.A.M. Inc.\r\n\r\n℗ 2000 Flip/Interscope Records. © 2000 Flip/Interscope Records.\r\nMade in the EU. Not for sale in the EU.\r\n\r\nIssued in standard jewel case with clear CD tray. Small custom sticker on front of jewel case.",
