         "title": "Splinter",
         "country": "Europe",
         "released": "2003",
         "notes": "Recorded at Henson Recording Studios, Los Angeles, CA and Southern Tracks Recording, Atlanta, GA.\nMixed at Southern Tracks Recording, Atlanta, GA.\nMastered at Oasis Mastering, Studio City, CA except \"Hit That\" mastered at Bernie Grundman Mastering, Hollywood, CA.\n\nStrings recorded at Henson Recording Studios.\n\nJim Lindberg appears courtesy of Epitaph Records.\nJack Grisham appears courtesy of Nitro Records.\n\n© 2003 Sony Music Entertainment Inc. / ℗ 2003 Sony Music Entertainment Inc.\n\nMade in Austria.\n\n2nd and 3rd cat# taken from the copyright section of the back insert.\nNo track durations given on release, taken from software.\n\nComes in a jewel case with clear tray and with a 16-page booklet including lyrics.\n\nThe enhanced section contains \"Da Hui\" Video, \"Da Hui\" Video (with audio commentary), Demo Studio Tour, Wallpapers and two downloadable MP3's.\n\nSome copies with a sticker on front that reads \"The New Album includes Hit That plus unreleased CD Extra™ footage 5122012000\".\nSome copies with Parental Advisory sticker on front.",
         "released_formatted": "2003",
