         "title": "Who Do You Think You Are / Mama",
         "country": "UK",
         "released": "1997-03-03",
         "notes": "All tracks published by Windswept Pacific Music Ltd / 19 Music / BMG Music Publishing Ltd, except track 2 published by Windswept Pacific Music Ltd/  PolyGram Music Publishing Ltd.\n\nTracks 3 & 4 remix produced and mixed for Def Mix Productions.\n\nAlso available the album \"[url=http://www.discogs.com/Spice-Girls-Spice/master/77259]Spice[/url]\".\n\nOn insert:\nPrinted in UK. The copyright in this recording is owned by Virgin Records Ltd. ℗ 1997 Virgin Records Ltd. © 1997 Virgin Records Ltd. © 1997 Virgin Records Ltd.\n\nOn disc:\nThe copyright in this recording is owned by Virgin Records Ltd. ℗ 1997 Virgin Records Ltd. © 1997 Virgin Records Ltd. © 1997 Virgin Records Ltd. Made in the UK.\n\nThe release is housed in a j-card case. Noted on the front cover as The UK Comic Relief Single for Red Nose Day '97.\n\nCD1 of a 2CD set. CD1 not stated on release. CD2 is VSCDG1623 listed as \"[url=http://www.discogs.com/Spice-Girls-Mama-Who-Do-You-Think-You-Are/release/663100]Mama / Who Do You Think You Are[/url]\". Both part of the double A side.",
