         "released": "2000-11-06",
         "notes": "Track 1 :Published by Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing Ltd, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 2: Published by Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Windswept 2, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 3: Published by Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing Ltd, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, First Avenue Music Ltd, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 4: Published by EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd, Sony/ATV Music Publishing Ltd (UK), 19 Music Ltd.\nTrack 5: Published by Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing Ltd, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, Copyright Control, Windswept 2, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 6: Published by Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 7: Published by Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, EMI Music Publishing Ltd,EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 8: Published by Fred Jerkins Music Publishing/Famous Music Corp, Rodney Jerkins Productions/EMI Music Publishing Ltd, EMI Music Publishing Ltd, Windswept 2, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTracks 9 & 10: Published by EMI April Music (ASCAP)/Flyte Tyme Tunes, EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd.\nTrack 11: Published by EMI Music Publishing (WP) Ltd, Universal Music Publishing.\n\nTracks 1, 5 & 7: Produced, all music and mixed for Darkchild Entertainment Inc.\nTracks 2 & 3: Produced and mixed for Darkchild Entertainment Inc.\nTracks 4 & 6: Produced and mixed for F.J. Productions/Darkchild Entertainment Inc.\nTrack 8: Mixed for Darkchild Entertainment Inc.\n\n℗ 2000 Virgin Records Limited\n© 2000 Virgin Records Limited\n\nMade in the EU\nPrinted in the EU\n\nAlmost identical to [r=22362433] that was both glass-mastered and pressed at EMI Uden. The only differences are the mould SID code (ifpi 25xx) indicating an EMI Italy pressing, and the appearance of [url=https://www.discogs.com/label/2618-SIAE]SIAE[/url], the Italian copyright administration society, on the disc label.",
